  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1208.02 Compliance Standards for Vinyl and Urethane Substrate Coating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1208.02 Compliance Standards for Vinyl and Urethane Substrate Coating. Any process applying a coating onto vinyl or urethane coated fabric, or vinyl or urethane sheets shall be limited at all times to an emission rate of 0.45 kg VOC/l, equivalent to 3.8 lb VOC/gallon, of coating, as applied, excluding water and exempt compounds.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1200.html"
